# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# msbuild output directories
**/bin/
**/obj/
/artifacts
/deployment/azure/*.bicepparam
!/deployment/azure/main.bicepparam.example
/solution/bin
/solution/obj

# Local signing material and environment-specific settings
*.snk
*.bicepparam
!main.bicepparam.example

# Local tooling guidance
/system-guidance.txt

# vs intermediate directory
**/.vs/

# MSBuild Binary and Structured Log
*.binlog
